        "region": "response-1",
        "callout": "These column names are completely made up"
      },
      "narration": "Look at this. You asked ChatGPT for a query and it wrote something gorgeous. One problem, not a single one of these column names is real. It literally made them up. \"customer_email\"? Your database calls that \"cust_eml\" because Dave from IT set it up in two thousand seven and Dave did not believe in vowels. \"last_order_date\"? That's actually \"lst_ord_dt.\" And \"orders_table\"? It's \"tbl_ord_hist.\" You'll paste this into your database tool, hit run, and get nothing but a wall of red errors. ChatGPT didn't write you a query, it wrote you a wish.",
